 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Booking an appointment",
     "texto": [
      "**Fastlege** is the family doctor; **legekontor** is the surgery where they work. You say **bestille time hos fastlegen** («book an appointment with the family doctor»). In Norwegian health information, **timebestilling** («appointment booking») is also used."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Prescriptions",
     "texto": [
      "A **resept** is a prescription. **Fornye resepten** means to ask for a renewal of a prescription that already exists. **Undersøke** means to examine; **pasient**, patient.",
      "In English we usually say «book an appointment with the doctor»; in Norwegian **hos** introduces the professional: **hos fastlegen**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
